{"id":17824148122,"name":"Re:Battlegrounds (Uncopylocked)","desc":"Discontinued, sorry. Open-source now tho.\n\nbattlegrounds about ReZero cause apparently there is no games about it. Ok but fr this is literally JJS but with Re:Zero. I made it for fun, and I don't really expect to get it popular or to monetize it that much. All in all, just thanks for playing my dumb game.\n\nCONTROLS:\nM1 - Attack\nM1 + Jump - Aerial Attack\nF - Block\nQ - Dash / Ragdoll cancel\nW + W - Run\nG - Awakening\nM - Moveset Menu\nB  - Emotes\n\ndestruction & combat based off JJS\n\nversion: 0.4.0\nfull release on v1.0.0; currently in beta (expect lots of bugs)\n\ntags: re zero, Re Zero, rezero, re:zero","path":"/game/17824148122-re-battlegrounds-uncopylocked","slug":"17824148122-re-battlegrounds-uncopylocked","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/14eb2c17b3edf93f18572529b0570cf639ccceecdece97512abca8249c6d79ea.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b68e73d62fd78e884805ed7ce184733c/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":209068,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-03-10T19:30:21.900Z","creator":{"name":"Pleiades Watchtower","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Re:Battlegrounds-(Uncopylocked)-Re-battlegrounds-Script-136075","_id":"69b0714d67b3dcfd3621114c","title":"Cool owner text above your head","game":{"_id":"69b0714d67b3dcfd36211149","gameId":17824148122,"name":"Re:Battlegrounds (Uncopylocked)","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":17824148122},"features":"Very cool when you spawn in then there will be a text above your head and it will say owner","tags":[],"script":"local Players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\n\nPlayers.PlayerAdded:Connect(function(player)\n\tplayer.CharacterAdded:Connect(function(character)\n\n\t\tlocal head = character:WaitForChild(\"Head\")\n\n\t\tlocal billboard = Instance.new(\"BillboardGui\")\n\t\tbillboard.Size = UDim2.new(0,200,0,50)\n\t\tbillboard.StudsOffset = Vector3.new(0,2,0)\n\t\tbillboard.AlwaysOnTop = true\n\t\tbillboard.Parent = head\n\n\t\tlocal text = Instance.new(\"TextLabel\")\n\t\ttext.Size = UDim2.new(1,0,1,0)\n\t\ttext.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n\t\ttext.Text = \"Owner\"\n\t\ttext.TextScaled = true\n\t\ttext.TextColor3 = Color3.fromRGB(255, 255, 0)\n\t\ttext.Font = Enum.Font.GothamBold\n\t\ttext.Parent = billboard\n\n\tend)\nend)","owner":{"_id":"69832effe96ccd295682caf5","username":"Dashhagewood4","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"69832effe96ccd295682caf5","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"verified":false,"views":473,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/e2788b81b8e0d6848f812e502370888695e3ac24c3e822e3f5b4405af6622bbf.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/17824148122-1773171021885.jpg","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/17824148122-1773171021885.jpg"},"likeCount":0,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-03-10T19:30:21.901Z","editBy":{"_id":"69832effe96ccd295682caf5","username":"Dashhagewood4","status":"offline","id":"69832effe96ccd295682caf5"},"keyLink":"","executes":45,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-14T01:44:41.874Z"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/e2788b81b8e0d6848f812e502370888695e3ac24c3e822e3f5b4405af6622bbf.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/17824148122-1773171021885.jpg","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/17824148122-177317102188